---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Contact RigGamer"
  description="Get in touch with the RigGamer team. Editorial enquiries, partnerships, and advertising."
>
<div class="legal-wrap">
  <div class="legal-inner">

    <div class="legal-hero">
      <div class="legal-kicker">// Contact</div>
      <h1>Contact RigGamer</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-body">

      <h2>General Enquiries</h2>
      <p>For general questions about our content, corrections, or feedback:<br />
      <a href="mailto:contact@riggamer.com">contact@riggamer.com</a></p>

      <h2>Advertising &amp; Partnerships</h2>
      <p>Interested in advertising on RigGamer or a partnership opportunity?<br />
      <a href="mailto:contact@riggamer.com">contact@riggamer.com</a> — subject line: <strong>Advertising</strong></p>
      <p>See our <a href="/advertise/">Advertise page</a> for traffic data and formats.</p>

      <h2>Press &amp; Game Publishers</h2>
      <p>For press access, review key requests, or game announcements:<br />
      <a href="mailto:contact@riggamer.com">contact@riggamer.com</a> — subject line: <strong>Press</strong></p>

      <h2>Privacy &amp; Legal</h2>
      <p>For data requests, takedowns, or legal matters:<br />
      <a href="mailto:contact@riggamer.com">contact@riggamer.com</a> — subject line: <strong>Legal</strong></p>
      <p>See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for data-related requests.</p>

      <div class="contact-note">
        <div class="contact-note-label">// Response time</div>
        <p>We aim to respond to all enquiries within 2 business days.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="legal-footer-nav">
      <a href="/about/">About</a>
      <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
</Base>

<style>
.legal-wrap { background: var(--bg); padding: 48px 0 80px; }
.legal-inner { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
.legal-hero { margin-bottom: 40px; padding-bottom: 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd); }
.legal-kicker { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--volt); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.legal-hero h1 { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.legal-body h2 { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em; margin: 2em 0 .7em; padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd); }
.legal-body p { color: var(--t2); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1em; }
.legal-body a { color: var(--volt); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(198,255,51,.3); transition: border-color .15s; }
.legal-body a:hover { border-color: var(--volt); }
.contact-note { margin-top: 2em; padding: 18px 20px; background: rgba(198,255,51,.06); border-left: 3px solid var(--volt); }
.contact-note-label { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--volt); margin-bottom: 6px; }
.contact-note p { color: var(--t2); font-size: 14px; margin: 0; }
.legal-footer-nav { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--brd); flex-wrap: wrap; }
.legal-footer-nav a { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 12px; color: var(--t3); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; transition: color .15s; }
.legal-footer-nav a:hover { color: var(--volt); }
</style>
